Description: Fusion v2.0 Vortex Programming Language
 A modern, polyglot systems programming language designed for the post-quantum era.
 .
 Features include algebraic effects, linear types, dependent types, refinement types,
 tail-call optimization, actors, pattern matching, post-quantum cryptography,
 quantum computing primitives, blockchain modules, and a multi-target compiler.
 .
 This package provides the Fusion compiler (fuc) and CLI (fusion).
